WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:34.320
<b>Luffy and Whitebeard</b>

3
00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.320
Vmy heart feels like it's gonna burst!

4
00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.900
Hey, partner! Can't you do anything?!

5
00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.390
How is my wax power gonna help us here?!

6
00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.540
Why are Luffy and the others falling from the sky?

7
00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:50.020
To answer that, we must turn back the clock a little.

8
00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.160
What was that?

9
00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.300
The wave stopped!

10
00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.540
What happened?!

11
00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:12.570
What the hell is this?!

12
00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:18.010
We're trapped in ice! Now we can't go anywhere at all!

13
00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:21.480
The only one who could've done this is...

14
00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:28.090
Take a look below. There's your answer.

15
00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:30.950
Old Whitebeard...

16
00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:33.020
The battle has already begun!

17
00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.260
Listen up, you guys!

18
00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:38.140
I've got an idea how we can get past this!

19
00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.340
Now that we've made it this far, we have to hurry!

20
00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:43.770
We've got less than three hours till they execute Ace!

21
00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:45.220
Yeah, so?

22
00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.840
What?!

23
00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.780
He wants us to slide the ship down the frozen wave?

24
00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:55.610
That's our only choice! First off, we have to break the ship out of the ice!

25
00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:59.560
Are you an idiot?! This is a warship! It's not gonna move that easily!

26
00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:01.020
That's right, you moron!

27
00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:05.290
If we work together, I know we can do this!

28
00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:08.360
I'm starting to feel like we really can...

29
00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:13.560
That's right! We've got the man who's gonna conquer the world, Captain Buggy, on our side!

30
00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:17.350
If the Captain says we can do it, then I know we can!

31
00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.220
Calling all ships and troops.

32
00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.740
Our target is site TOTTZ.

33
00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.850
Change formation and initiate Operation Three.

34
00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:31.360
It's a broadcast of the Navy's plans...

35
00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.880
Make haste with the preparations.

36
00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.690
TOT... What was that about?

37
00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.160
Dunno... Probably some sort of code.

38
00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:43.370
Once the preparations are complete, we'll push the schedule forward and execute Ace!

39
00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.660
Over!

40
00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.280
Luffy-kun...

41
00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.500
Let's hurry!

42
00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.180
Vwe can't wait any longer. There's no time to argue about this!

43
00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:57.180
Everyone! Vwe're going with Straw Hat-boy's idea!

44
00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:02.450
Go!

45
00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:09.520
H-Hey!

46
00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.620
Wrong way!

47
00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.940
That brings us back to the present, where Luffy and the others are falling.

48
00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:56.500
What happened?! Was that a warship falling out of the sky?!

49
00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.040
It's water... We're saved.

50
00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.400
We fell into the sea.

51
00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.640
I thought we were gonna crash into the ice and die.

52
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.610
Why is there no ice in this one spot?

53
00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:09.800
Climb up! Get higher!

54
00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:13.450
This ain't nothing compared to the water torture in Hell!

55
00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:26.770
I swear, these Devil Fruit users...

56
00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:15.280
Ace!!!

57
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:20.220
Luffy!!!

58
00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.220
I finally found you!

59
00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.160
Hey! Is that...

60
00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.800
Crocodile!

61
00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:31.100
That's not who I meant! Who's that huge-faced guy?

62
00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:35.360
Vi'd expect no less from the Navy's full force. They're not to be underestimated.

63
00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:38.100
Get ready for me, world!

64
00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:43.010
Ace! I'm here to save you!

65
00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:46.180
We're all here to save you!

66
00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.950
Garp! It's your damn family again!

67
00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.880
Luffy!

68
00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.550
Look! It's not only Straw Hat!

69
00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:58.420
Jinbe! And even Ivankov from the Revolutionary Army!

70
00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:03.190
And behind them is a horde of history's most notorious pirates!

71
00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.900
They're the Impel Down escapees!

72
00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:10.100
The man who everybody talks about. Straw Hat.

73
00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:13.710
Straw... Hat...

74
00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.460
What's he doing here?!

75
00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.880
That's not his usual crew, is it?

76
00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:22.780
Luffy! I am so glad you are safe!

77
00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.780
You have to see this, Helmeppo-san!

78
00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:28.050
What is it? Nothing is gonna surprise me anym-

79
00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:29.460
Straw Hat!

80
00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:34.390
And I heard he'd been imprisoned in Impel Down! He really is amazing!

81
00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:37.330
That's one hell of a team he brought with him.

82
00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:43.770
I didn't think I'd be seeing him again so soon.

83
00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:47.240
Hey, that's the little brother Ace is always talking about.

84
00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.230
Now we've got all the Warlords here, new and old!

85
00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:56.810
And that's the troublemaker rookie, Straw Hat?

86
00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.950
Smoker-san, look!

87
00:08:58.950 --> 00:08:59.610
I know.

88
00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.480
You're mine!

89
00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.860
Straw Hat and Crocodile...

90
00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.990
Why are they working together?

91
00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.960
So that's him...

92
00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:14.250
Not only is he the grandson of Garp the Hero...

93
00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.960
he's also the son of the Revolutionary Dragon...

94
00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:22.840
We'll have to eliminate him as well.

95
00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:32.630
Of all the things you could have done, you joined forces with Straw Hat Luffy...

96
00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.390
Is this your answer, Jinbe?!

97
00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.660
That's right! I quit being a Warlord!

98
00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:43.700
Any way you look at it, that's a strange team...

99
00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:47.880
I seriously doubt they all have the same objective.

100
00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.340
At least, not on this battlefield.

101
00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:05.740
Where's Croco-boy?

102
00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:09.540
Huh? Well, considering the situation...

103
00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:11.510
There he is!

104
00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.030
He's trying to beat me to it!

105
00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.330
Crocodile is moving in on Whitebeard!

106
00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:22.100
Old Man!

107
00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:25.300
Long time no see, Whitebeard!

108
00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.710
You never learn, do you?

109
00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:55.630
So you already made preparations to fight me, huh?

110
00:10:55.630 --> 00:11:00.250
Once you become wet, you can't turn into sand!

111
00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:11.200
I honored our agreement and helped you get here.

112
00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.920
Why are you defending Whitebeard?

113
00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.740
So this old guy really is Whitebeard?

114
00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.560
Then don't touch him!

115
00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.230
Ace likes this old guy!

116
00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:24.560
You're pretty good, Ace's brother.

117
00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.000
Don't let him near the Old Man!

118
00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:50.910
When a man as great as you came back from the
East Blue missing an arm, everyone was surprised.

119
00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:54.680
What sort of enemy did you give it up to?

120
00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.430
That left arm of yours.

121
00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.890
I wagered it...

122
00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:03.870
on the new era.

123
00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:07.910
Kid... That straw hat of yours...

124
00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:11.740
It looks a lot like the one Red Hair used to wear.

125
00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:15.120
You know Shanks, old guy?

126
00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:18.750
I'm holding it for Shanks.

127
00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:23.120
Look at this, Old Man! This is my little brother!

128
00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:29.050
Have you come to save your brother?

129
00:12:29.050 --> 00:12:30.060
That's right!

130
00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.730
Don't you understand what you're up against?!

131
00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:42.570
Someone like you doesn't stand a chance here!

132
00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:46.080
Shut up! That's not for you to decide!

133
00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:52.380
I know perfectly well! You wanna be the Pirate King, don't you?!

134
00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:56.820
But I'm going to be the Pirate King, not you!

135
00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:18.040
You're pretty damn cheeky...

136
00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:22.980
I won't show mercy if you slow me down, you spoiled brat!

137
00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.520
I'm doing what I want to do!

138
00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:30.380
I'm gonna save Ace myself!

139
00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.870
H-He's...

140
00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.170
standing up to Whitebeard!

141
00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:35.010
Unbelievable!

142
00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:48.470
I can execute every one of them, right, Sengoku-san?

143
00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:50.170
Of course.

144
00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:54.110
They're moving Ace's execution time up?

145
00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:56.380
You're sure that's what they said?

146
00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:59.540
After they finish some kind of preparations.

147
00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.590
Then some code stuff I didn't really get.

148
00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:06.890
Since you wanna save Ace, too, I thought I'd tell you!

149
00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:11.760
I see. This is rather important news.

150
00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:13.300
Sorry about before.

151
00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:14.870
Don't worry about it.

152
00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:19.340
Why are they having such a friendly chat?!

153
00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:21.110
Right!

154
00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:23.640
Ace, I'm coming now!

155
00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.480
How is he so confident?!

156
00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:39.060
Move it!

157
00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.510
So that's Ace's little brother?

158
00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.980
Don't get in the kid's way!

159
00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.060
Third Division, start your assault!

160
00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.520
We're going too.

161
00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.840
Seriously?!

162
00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:59.820
Fourteenth Division, clear his path!

163
00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.550
Yes sir, Commander Jil!

164
00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:06.380
Luffy...

165
00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:11.360
Just one man's recklessness got them this riled up?

166
00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:14.630
Regardless, this won't alter our plans.

167
00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:16.920
Don't lose focus!

168
00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.930
Proceed as instructed!

169
00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:22.000
That Sengoku...

170
00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:27.260
Now that he's up against pirates, there's no need to keep the old execution time?

171
00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:30.880
These "preparations" he's planning must be the key.

172
00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.310
Old Man!

173
00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:38.220
According to a Navy transmission, they're going to accelerate Ace's execution.

174
00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.620
Yeah, I heard.

175
00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:46.760
We'll play right into their plans if we start panicking over this leaked information.

176
00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.560
He's not sloppy. It's no accident.

177
00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:56.430
Not coming from that man.

178
00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.140
Shove through!

179
00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.940
Light-speed kicks?!

180
00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:11.910
Don't get carried away. I won't let you through that easily.

181
00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:14.220
It's Admiral Kizaru!

182
00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.160
It's you, from Sabaody!

183
00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:24.660
The Celestial Dragons will be on my case if I let you get away again.

184
00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:26.900
Straw Hat Luffy.

185
00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:31.970
That Straw Hat guy's about to die!

186
00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.900
Death Wink!

187
00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:46.750
I want to turn back and go home now!

188
00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:49.440
What, Captain Buggy?!

189
00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.420
I can't believe what you're saying!

190
00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:52.790
Huh?

191
00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:56.810
You wanna turn the tables of this battle? Are you serious?!

192
00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:58.280
Well, I...

193
00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.170
Nothing less from the legendary crew!

194
00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:02.680
He doesn't even flinch facing Admiral Kizaru!

195
00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:03.770
Well, no...

196
00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:06.170
You guys only hear what you want to hear!

197
00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:08.340
Straw Hat-boy, are vyou alright?

198
00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.940
That was close! Thanks, Iva-chan!

199
00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:15.210
It is vmy mission to protect vyou from death!

200
00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.120
Kizaru again!

201
00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.790
Wait, no. That's...

202
00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:22.620
Kuma!

203
00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:27.120
That's the bear-guy who sent us all flying!

204
00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.360
Rolling Aesthe!

205
00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.200
Bartholomew Kuma!

206
00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.820
This is terrible!

207
00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.980
Even though he's standing over with the other Warlords,

208
00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:48.480
he's shooting lasers at vme after all vwe've been through together?

209
00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:05.860
How unlucky for you to bump into us.

210
00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:09.470
Straw Hat. This is where it ends for you!

211
00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.340
Huh... Who're you?

212
00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:14.340
I'm Fullbody!

213
00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:19.080
I still owe you from the floating restaurant Baratie!

214
00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:21.580
Ah... the guy who got his ass kicked by Sanji.

215
00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:25.780
Don't tell me you've forgotten these chakrams?

216
00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:28.990
Aren't you that hypnotist from Usopp's village?

217
00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:30.320
What are you doing here?

218
00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.650
With the Navy's help, I've perfected...

219
00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.440
Jango-sama's Hypnotism.

220
00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.250
Two chakrams. Twice as effective.

221
00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:42.270
With "One, Two, Jango" you will fall asleep.

222
00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:45.170
One, two...

223
00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:46.490
Jango!

224
00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:56.640
What's going on here?

225
00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.320
Hina disappointed.

226
00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.310
You... I met you back in Alabasta!

227
00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:06.490
I don't have any more time to waste with you guys!

228
00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:08.800
I won't let you run.

229
00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.200
Kimono Sleeve Cage!

230
00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:19.040
Everything that passes through my body... is locked tight.

231
00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:21.150
There it is, her signature phrase!

232
00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.340
Now you shall be captivated by Madame Hina!

233
00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.740
I've had enough of being in cages!

234
00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:26.810
Gear Second

235
00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:34.560
He's fast!

236
00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.720
I couldn't see him!

237
00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.060
Hina negligence.

238
00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:40.270
Our negligence too.

239
00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:43.890
Madame Hina has bound our bodies and our hearts.

240
00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.530
Stop right there!

241
00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:07.820
Every single one of these guys is strong!

242
00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:14.430
Straw Hat!

243
00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:17.230
His ability is impressive, as always.

244
00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.770
That reminds me.

245
00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:23.220
I should take his shadow once again, and bring Oars back to life with it.

246
00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:28.870
Come out and play, zombie warriors!

247
00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:43.720
Now, my minions, go and capture Straw Hat!

248
00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.490
Moriah!

249
00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.220
Another tough guy.

250
00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.840
Have them back!

251
00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:11.750
There's more!

252
00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.730
Of course! This is a battlefield!

253
00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:18.360
People dying simply adds to my zombie army!

254
00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:20.000
Capture Straw Hat!

255
00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.260
He's the culprit behind the prison break!

256
00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.660
Keep it up!

257
00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:28.030
Your opponents are all commissioned officers.

258
00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:31.440
How far do you think you will get?

259
00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:35.510
Luffy...

260
00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:57.460
Keep away, Luffy!

261
00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:15.910
You oughta know already!

262
00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:18.520
You and I are both pirates!

263
00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:21.550
You should be out sailing however you want!

264
00:22:21.550 --> 00:22:24.820
Me, I have my own adventures!

265
00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:28.660
Me, I have my own friends!

266
00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:30.830
Ace...

267
00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:35.270
You have no right to interfere with that!

268
00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.880
A weakling like you coming to rescue me...

269
00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:39.440
Move!

270
00:22:39.780 --> 00:22:43.270
Do you think I'm gonna let that happen?!

271
00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:45.440
That would be too humiliating.

272
00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:49.410
Go back, Luffy! Why did you come?!

273
00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:53.980
Please, Luffy...

274
00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:57.550
I don't want to take you with me!

275
00:22:58.280 --> 00:23:01.620
This is my failure.

276
00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:04.700
I'm...

277
00:23:05.830 --> 00:23:07.800
your brother!

278
00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:16.040
Didn't ya know?

279
00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:20.160
When you exchange sake cups, you become brothers.

280
00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:25.400
From today onward, we are brothers!

281
00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:36.060
Just then, he definitely said "brother"...

282
00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:37.830
That means he is also Roger's...?

283
00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:40.920
Ace's parents died after he was born!

284
00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:42.730
There's no way he can have a younger brother!

285
00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:45.720
Those stupid pirate "rules"...

286
00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:48.550
I've never heard of them!

287
00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:49.780
Don't you get it?

288
00:23:53.190 --> 00:23:56.410
Go, my zombie minions!

289
00:24:04.690 --> 00:24:06.360
S-Sea water?

290
00:24:09.320 --> 00:24:10.360
Jinbe!

291
00:24:10.360 --> 00:24:12.560
They're weak against salt.

292
00:24:12.560 --> 00:24:15.100
Moriah, those zombies of yours...

293
00:24:16.170 --> 00:24:19.340
Luffy-kun, leave the zombies to me.

294
00:24:19.340 --> 00:24:19.840
I'm counting on you.

295
00:24:19.840 --> 00:24:21.700
Knight of the Sea Jinbe!

296
00:24:21.700 --> 00:24:23.070
Former member of the Seven Warlords...

297
00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:24.440
What are you doing?

298
00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:28.280
It's only one rookie... Don't let him dictate the entire war this way!

299
00:24:28.280 --> 00:24:30.680
Out of my way!

300
00:24:30.680 --> 00:24:33.000
I'll crush him!

301
00:24:38.890 --> 00:24:42.290
That man will be a danger in the future.

302
00:24:42.290 --> 00:24:46.060
He was raised with his sworn brother, Ace.

303
00:24:46.060 --> 00:24:51.740
But his actual bloodline makes him the son of the Revolutionary, Dragon!

304
00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:53.840
The Revolutionary Dragon?!

305
00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:56.170
The son of the world's most fearsome criminal?!

306
00:24:56.170 --> 00:24:59.030
And I know this person!

307
00:24:59.030 --> 00:25:01.010
His papa's a big deal!

308
00:25:01.010 --> 00:25:02.770
He's gone and said it.

309
00:25:02.770 --> 00:25:03.710
Luffy-san...!

310
00:25:06.150 --> 00:25:07.610
Luffy...

311
00:25:07.610 --> 00:25:10.750
Knowing you're the child of a demon makes me...

312
00:25:14.380 --> 00:25:15.860
So that's how it is?!

313
00:25:16.540 --> 00:25:18.080
I get it now.

314
00:25:18.080 --> 00:25:19.200
Bastard!

315
00:25:32.620 --> 00:25:35.430
That solves the riddle from Loguetown.

316
00:25:36.320 --> 00:25:39.040
That's why Dragon saved him...

317
00:25:39.040 --> 00:25:40.720
Did you just hear that?

318
00:25:42.460 --> 00:25:44.330
Dragon... The Dragon?!

319
00:25:44.330 --> 00:25:46.020
Head Office! Head Office!

320
00:25:46.020 --> 00:25:47.700
This is Sabaody Archipelago.

321
00:25:47.700 --> 00:25:48.770
Big news!

322
00:25:48.770 --> 00:25:51.060
T-Tell the world!

323
00:25:52.100 --> 00:25:54.230
We mustn't let him live!

324
00:25:55.300 --> 00:25:57.030
Take him down with everything we have!

325
00:25:58.310 --> 00:25:59.680
Fine.

326
00:25:59.680 --> 00:26:02.080
There's no point in hiding it anymore.

327
00:26:02.080 --> 00:26:06.810
Luffy is already a notorious outlaw. This news won't make any difference now.

328
00:26:08.640 --> 00:26:11.580
Raising them as brothers was a big mistake!

329
00:26:37.060 --> 00:26:39.710
Ace!

330
00:26:41.850 --> 00:26:44.580
Say whatever the hell you want!

331
00:26:44.580 --> 00:26:47.520
I'm saving you, even if I die!

332
00:26:48.990 --> 00:26:50.480
That kid.

333
00:26:50.480 --> 00:26:52.760
Only Straw Hat could say that to him!

334
00:26:52.760 --> 00:26:54.980
We're Ace's family!

335
00:26:54.980 --> 00:26:56.490
Show us that you can save him!

336
00:26:58.380 --> 00:27:01.630
Marco, don't let him die.

337
00:27:02.390 --> 00:27:03.270
Roger that.

338
00:27:10.580 --> 00:27:11.890
Luffy...
